  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Solaimurugan vs The District Collector on 2 December, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P(MD)No.63 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 02.12.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P(MD)No.6395 of 2019 and W.M.P(MD)Nos.5099 to 5101 of 2019 Solaimurugan ... Petitioner Vs 1.The District Collector, Madurai District, Madurai. 2.The Tahsildar cum Administrative Magistrate, Madurai North Taluk, Madurai. 3.G.Kannan ... Respondents Prayer: Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of Constitution of India, to issue a Writ of Certiorari, calling for the records of th impugned order passed by the second respondent proceedings in Na.Ka.No.04686/17/E3 dated 14.03.2019 quash the same. For Petitioner : Ms.A.Banumathy For RR 1 & 2 : Mr.D.Gandhi Raj Special Government Pleader For R 3 : Mr.PT.S.Narendravasan Solaimurugan vs The District Collector on 2 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/82636449/ 1 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/5 W.P(MD)No ORDER",
    "facts": "This Writ Petition has been filed by the petitioner as against the order passed by the second respondent dated 14.03.2019 thereby directing to conduct an enquiry by the Public Health, Food Safety Officer as well as the District Pollution Control Board, Madurai and also ordering to close the shop till the final order passed by the authorities.",
